name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Nightlife","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"gVw224_IlTrx3KHEgFBtMg","review_id":"qsqEXGGMnmJQLnhqwwntRg","date":"2017-09-26T03:24:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9304975867271423,"text_excerpt":"This place is great. Right across from the Frenchmen hotel, we stopped in for some appetizers before hitting the festival again. We were not disappointed. The live music pulled us in. It was an old style jazz and tap group that really set the mood and genuine New Orleans feel. We opted for Louisiana favorites of crab cakes and fried green tomatoes. The portions for the tomatoes was on the skimpy side but the crab cakes were very plump. They were presented very well and tasted even better. I can't complain about anything they had to offer and would definitely be back if I'm in the area again."},{"business_id":"gVw224_IlTrx3KHEgFBtMg","review_id":"yx1Y4NiOjYM7XaEOfFRcKg","date":"2018-12-22T14:54:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9300611019134521,"text_excerpt":"Super cool place on Frenchmen Street. We came at about 1 o'clock so it wasn't very busy but still great energy. Our server was very nice, friendly. And we made it clear we are from out of town she's that gave us lots of suggestions to make our visit to New Orleans even better! The music was great. The drink specials were awesome. This is definitely a place I'd like to stop by again at night on a future visit to New Orleans."},{"business_id":"gVw224_IlTrx3KHEgFBtMg","review_id":"_WxT7m1potDJsG1OMppYEQ","date":"2019-09-04T18:58:55","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9261589050292969,"text_excerpt":"This was, to me, the best place on Frenchmen St. I had what was probably the best Bloody Mary of my life in this bar. I wanted one to shake off the remnants of the day prior, I ended up with one more to remember the taste and a third to get going on today. We sat right in front of the band which gave a first hand account of every note of the wonderful music that is jazz. Our server at the table was super friendly and efficient and made our visit extra enjoyable. Bamboula's, thank you for being an establishment with great drinks, great music, great food and an overall great vibe. I look forward to returning here when I visit New Orleans again."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"gVw224_IlTrx3KHEgFBtMg","photo_id":"QtxCJeYvZ_KmcFSi9aaDQQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/QtxCJeYvZ_KmcFSi9aaDQQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8936862945556641},{"business_id":"gVw224_IlTrx3KHEgFBtMg","photo_id":"KqcwR3mQAe701hBIMMppkw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/KqcwR3mQAe701hBIMMppkw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8934954404830933},{"business_id":"gVw224_IlTrx3KHEgFBtMg","photo_id":"mCYH0_SjW9T428baei1g_g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/mCYH0_SjW9T428baei1g_g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8756159543991089},{"business_id":"gVw224_IlTrx3KHEgFBtMg","photo_id":"blq